nter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Write a Python program that reads the contents of a text file, processes the text, sorts it, and writes the sorted data into another file.</p><p data-ref="45016fcf-54c4-4d5c-88d8-d60cea9265ab" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="ab22ee8b-44fe-4323-9824-a0f63a5e3792"></p><p data-ref="4a11e6b2-2b93-4bf4-9ccc-4e11918a8be1" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">The program should perform the following operations:</p><ul data-ref="c1f8d217-1764-44ec-b326-69cfebb14bf6" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="5b792adc-44b1-41b1-bf79-d1363fa8e6a0">Read the name of an input text file from the user.</li><li data-ref="ae282b8a-6879-4c7e-a27c-9e9961d1a4d1">Open and read all lines from the specified file.</li><li data-ref="f345e6d9-2233-4171-9bce-0638483e7f0c">Remove leading and trailing whitespace from each line.</li><li data-ref="04bc86c3-19dd-4c35-8e5f-fad85e84c819">Convert each line to lowercase.</li><li dat