</span></div><div class="mb-3" data-ref="8e603dd3-2ed7-4ec3-bae3-70d86b629c8b"><div class="ml-1 mb-3" data-ref="64f00305-6b1d-4a39-ae3d-63aa45a6ad42"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="5f1b5523-9953-4a1d-ad50-477808526df1" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Source Code: </b></div><div class="user-solution" style="page-break-inside: auto" data-ref="971f3b16-6d06-4272-a82d-8090f0d18e94" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><div class="px-3 pt-2 pb-1" style="font-family: monospace !important;border-radius: 4px 4px 0 0; border: 1px solid black; break-after: avoid; page-break-after: avoid;" data-ref="fb91310f-acfe-4c27-9128-263666ce61bf" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">sortLower.py</div> <pre style="overflow: visible; border: 1px solid black; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 4px;" class="px-3 pt-2 pb-1" data-ref="112d2a7e-0c01-4d1a-a917-91b90ac1a052" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">try:
	filename=input().strip()
	with open(filename,'r') as file:
		lines=file.readlines()
		lines=[line.strip().lower() for line in lines]
		lines.sort()
	with open('sorted_output.txt','w') as file:
		for line in lines:
			file.write(line+'\n')
	for line in lines:
		print(line)
