ndisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="7846baf2-6f33-42d2-97a4-9ea33b038b00"><mjx-mtext class="mjx-n" data-ref="a9514904-2a96-4c64-a2be-e0915726a1ed"><mjx-c class="mjx-c69" data-ref="b2157e3d-167e-4695-9864-8f25835e835e"></mjx-c><mjx-c class="mjx-c6E" data-ref="908f0554-9174-4080-9667-44c39a2a8224"></mjx-c><mjx-c class="mjx-c64" data-ref="604751c0-9377-4e33-85d9-2757fa4e13a0"></mjx-c><mjx-c class="mjx-c65" data-ref="c517a5cc-e69a-48a3-93b1-105e57a5b456"></mjx-c><mjx-c class="mjx-c78" data-ref="80ca6822-2e31-437c-befc-41839413eb87"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="be4b5950-116f-476e-86b7-962d89914cc8"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="6e0e94f3-2828-4b1f-944b-e8c4254a70c6"><mtext data-ref="fcadce1f-1b42-45c3-9c6c-ae1613c4ab6b">index</mtext></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>) specifying the row position to access an element using integer indexing.</li><li data-ref="d69f2868-6f6e-4059-a358-8b9cdf738279">Display the row in the array at the specified index. If the index is invalid, output "Invalid"((i.e., not in the range 0 to <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 119.5%; position: relative;" data-ref="8e6bc23e-4e7e-43b1-b358-76b01f2961ef" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="c9a47b6c-8035-4906-8da2-52b06c506e33"><mjx-mtext class="mjx-n" data-ref="84af7225-158e-4932-b4e2-340ef044883e"><mjx-c class="mjx-c72" data-ref="53fb87db-1098-4e44-9cf1-4473fba19710"></mjx-c><mjx-c class="mjx-c6F" data-ref="016bc249-9965-41fa-9b29-048f3fbc2329"></mjx-c><mjx-c class="mjx-c77" data-ref="edbe1af0-44f5-414b-a014-752613911bec"></mjx-c><mjx-c class="mjx-c73" data-ref="c94c9069-ed9b-434d-99f3-9edacb18ff6e"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="15d2778e-6360-4679-8f74-fa35c0d47798"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="837083ce-abe1-406b-b77a-4bf664a05b6f"><mtext data-ref="45a9ec2d-b46d-469f-b3f2-7bb48d46fd7e">rows</mtext></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> - 1).</li><li data-ref="f0e68e0d-4105-4966-b443-1b3a357463d1">Next line: A string of space-separated integers (0 or 1) representing boolean indices for selecting rows from the array. If the number of boolean values is not equal to the number of rows, output "Invalid".</li><li data-ref="7e34421f-5d9a-48c0-8ad4-cdb89a7acb5c">Display the boolean index array used for selection followed by elements from the array that correspond to True values in the boolean index array.</li></ul></span></div><div class="mb-3" data-ref="33388eb4-20a0-4569-992e-32ebee3fa688"><div class="ml-1 mb-3" data-ref="c7b530f5-3242-49c9-853a-b55c854c5c41"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="1677e6ec-c900-49c5-b3b3-287cc1b03f54" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Source Code: </b></div><div class="user-solution" style="page-break-inside: auto" data-ref="510db0c5-8e8a-4224-86c1-040709ac0f38" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><div class="px-3 pt-2 pb-1" style="font-family: monospace !important;border-radius: 4px 4px 0 0; border: 1px solid black; break-after: avoid; page-break-after: avoid;" data-ref="1de56be5-a0da-427d-a410-20406c2d9e06" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">array_operations.py</div> <pre style="overflow: visible; border: 1px solid black; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 4px;" class="px-3 pt-2 pb-1" data-ref="6e9b53f2-ccec-46ba-adc4-8b7f2107f2f2" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">import numpy as np
rows,cols=map(int,input().split())
elements=[]
for i in range(rows):
	elements.append(list(map(int,input().split())))
arr=np.array(elements)
print(arr)

start,end=map(int,input().split())
if start&lt;0 or end&lt;0 or start&gt;=rows or end&gt;rows or start&gt;=end:
	print("Invalid")
else:
	print(arr[start:end])

index=int(input())
if index&lt;0 or index&gt;=rows:
	print("Invalid")
else:
	print(arr[index])

values=list(map(int,input().split()))
if len(values)!=rows or any(x not in (0,1)for x in values):
	print("Invalid")
else:
	bool_index=np.array(values,dtype=bool)
