8d47dc-f541-48f5-86f7-a2300a3d98c7" data-split-original="true"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="738eff19-ec3d-4250-8c13-761d1c7ce311" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="ec736257-531e-4a21-bc71-ed8ccbea029d"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="fcbead1a-846a-46ac-a52e-c2a38124c357" data-split-to="fcbead1a-846a-46ac-a52e-c2a38124c357" data-split-original="true" data-last-split-element="true" data-align-last-split-element="auto"><p data-ref="d3e7fe7e-4f1c-49f6-892a-3320fb55591c" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Python provides built-in support for complex numbers. Once a complex number is created, it behaves like any other numeric data type, allowing you to perform arithmetic operations using standard operators.</p><p data-ref="33322a5d-5a8e-4058-8893-0011524df930" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="b77126c2-53bc-40df-97f4-b20323b82f5b"></p><p data-ref="a4b06f31-e74b-4d2d-9985-25080e94ba88" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">A complex number can be entered using the <span class="ql-font-monospace" data-ref="fc2d1e90-228a-482b-9235-b5dd8ada27e7">complex()</span> function.</p><p data-ref="0402c4cf-bd36-4b75-831c-dd58327c72fe" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="2001b66f-5b45-43de-bcf4-e464a77e892c">Syntax:</strong></p><pre class="ql-syntax" spellcheck="false" data-ref="f0f454cc-f4ef-493b-9d08-aeb8bf02cde6" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">complex(input())
</pre><p data-ref="18f4e825-fc7b-4982-a091-59f9008d725a" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">When the user enters a value such as 3+4j or 10-2j, the complex() function converts the input string into a complex number.</p><p data-ref="0e9d703c-0f17-4837-867f-b11b35473a21" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="c23d7542-9837-43b8-8b4b-09a11a604227"></p><p data-ref="43874e98-b9e6-4cff-9898-edd3657f0773" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="5fb6800f-6b8e-42ae-bd50-0ad923a55550">Example:</strong></p><pre class="ql-syntax" spellcheck="false" data-ref="199a028d-f231-40f0-894b-82a7e9fe23e0" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">c = complex(input("Enter a complex number: "))
