e-0a7edc8dbb2c" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="d2073358-aeef-4f60-8ea8-d71480c7e0a6" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="b036138c-9117-4b69-8b9b-016d6d5a8ed8"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="2d8c4276-24a3-499e-b934-c2f4c4a7d5d7"><p data-ref="df7d740b-88da-4340-8fd3-c75e169f8a45" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Write a Python program that defines a function <strong data-ref="b01d02eb-8811-485d-866b-8618b2597f9f">calculate_stats</strong> to calculate multiple values from a given list of numbers. The function should return three values: the sum, the mean, and the maximum of the numbers.</p><p data-ref="592aeeba-86c2-4498-8ef3-fb8dc4eafdbc" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="e1cf7517-f6e4-403d-a7fb-00e4d370abf7"></p><p data-ref="1e36981f-ff33-46a1-a085-920db5833a20" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="a1592889-7c1f-4e15-98f1-ab3e75d64484">Input Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="a0006179-0439-4d46-a6f9-561d9d49f6c6"