122-f597726c598e">The second line prints the mean (average) of the integers, formatted to two decimal places.</li><li data-ref="d917aa64-aaf7-43b9-86b1-2372d801f6fd">The third line prints the maximum value among the integers.</li></ul><p data-ref="e9d77a80-c4ee-479e-8fa9-d79e74f772b3" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="8dac4fdd-1d08-4a7d-8791-23e41e507fee"></p><p data-ref="25691765-01d7-4274-87a2-43f4f6b140c8" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="8e1068f6-5a3c-4eae-add6-15d1883aea3d">Constraints: </strong></p><ul data-ref="463aa24b-b769-4f96-b66c-d094485b59ab" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="ef83390f-6ded-4c34-a7fb-58b607f6e46c"><mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 119.5%; position: relative;" data-ref="fb5d7697-62e8-4e9d-b4b4-06f8846cb4d0" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="d6367c88-260b-41bb-9749-0f859123846a"><mjx-mn class="mjx-n" data-ref="4494ae54-5337-46de-8c0c-245b22682995"><mjx-c class="mjx-c30" data