6ddbc4ce8f" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="a78cfadb-5a17-40a7-adbf-b386dc74d870" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="c0d53cb8-105a-4e5d-bf26-f43445aa7f67"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="25a487c8-bde4-4178-83fb-d318dd8119c4"><p data-ref="708604d5-8ff0-43dd-9f30-65e593f946f8" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Write a Python program that adds a new key-value pair to an existing dictionary.</p><p data-ref="568bf2a3-21e0-4a86-bdee-1aceb36c21d4" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="8e5fc0f8-5e88-4603-940e-f590d208be7e"></p><p data-ref="db7d07d6-253e-4828-8240-7678965982bd" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="cae03282-5421-4c65-88cd-42b722e2db01">Input Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="a83da0fe-e48e-46f2-b77d-2f01f7b45940" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="