le="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="dfa2716f-b2c0-4e01-be37-527df6684a0b" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="394db9ce-cc65-4fa8-b689-9ef0347eb762"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="062b84de-01ac-45aa-87d1-e6f59b41fec1"><p data-ref="f226b30d-3a1e-4c2d-80c2-a10a355cbce0" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Write a Python program that reads a file and prints the number of lines, words, and characters present in the file.</p><p data-ref="67cde829-2e6c-49d8-b6e6-7571dcf0848d" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="4a660c65-0088-4a38-80d1-317079bc7ea4"></p><p data-ref="3f7f010c-3a5b-4665-9b69-25fef9c014c6" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="637e0fd7-ce5c-43ec-867b-79e5d74d2ba6">Input Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="2185b9eb-0a89-4ae6-b50f-a6264263f4d8" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counte